{2}-4x+4+{y}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe require that the point $P$ lies on the curve $y=\\frac{x+1}{\\sqrt{x}}.$ Substituting this into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}S & ={x}^{2}-4x+4+{y}^{2} \\\\  & ={x}^{2}-4x+4+{(\\frac{x+1}{\\sqrt{x}})}^{2} \\\\  & ={x}^{2}-4x+4+\\frac{(x+1)^{2}}{x} \\\\  & ={x}^{2}-4x+4+\\frac{{x}^{2}+2x+1}{x} \\\\  & ={x}^{2}-4x+4+x+2+\\frac{1}{x} \\\\  & ={x}^{2}-3x+\\frac{1}{x}+6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the minimum distance, we take the first derivative of $S(x)$ and equate it to zero. This gives the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{S}^{′}(x)=2x-3-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399989 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399990 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399989 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399991 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399989 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399992 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399989 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399993 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399989 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399994 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399989 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399989 1077 "selection" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399989 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399991 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399989 1080 #uuid "e83f0ff3-bc35-5721-8d0b-7a1f7fc531ac" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399990 1081 "\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}}" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399990 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399990 1084 #uuid "87a1b81f-6a01-51e3-8077-b35d6d3c965e" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399991 1081 "\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399991 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399991 1084 #uuid "121d4c99-f9fd-560e-b8d1-8cf12f76ef01" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399992 1081 "\\frac{1}{x}" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399992 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399992 1084 #uuid "37c5a8a6-835d-5948-a4e4-bc4371e503af" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399993 1081 "\\frac{1}{2x}" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399993 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399993 1084 #uuid "ed218258-9b28-520e-b77f-948add6059b7" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399994 1081 "\\frac{2}{{x}^{3}}" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399994 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399994 1084 #uuid "1a5f6dc5-0cb2-55ae-b3d1-11c8ecd253e5" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399995 1068 #edb/ref 17592186399996 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399995 1069 "q-119037" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399995 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399995 1071 "Find the general solution to the differential equation  ${f}^{′}(x)-6{e}^{-3x}=1.$" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399995 1072 #uuid "8e422fe9-fc97-5df0-b6a5-ce1fd6f9f5cf" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399995 1074 "First, we rearrange the equation to isolate the derivative term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =1+6{e}^{-3x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides of the equation with respect to $x,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {f}^{′}(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (1+6{e}^{-3x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\text{d}x+6\\int {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x+6(-\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{-3x}) \\\\  & =x-2{e}^{-3x}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399996 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399997 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399996 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399998 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399996 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399999 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399996 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400000 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399996 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400001 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399996 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399996 1077 "selection" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399996 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399998 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399996 1080 #uuid "8f36605a-43ff-547f-a708-ab078c73b400" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399997 1081 "f(x)=2(x+9{e}^{-3x})+C" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399997 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399997 1084 #uuid "73b6602d-f037-52b0-8c48-d0885dedafc2" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399998 1081 "f(x)=x-2{e}^{-3x}+C" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399998 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399998 1084 #uuid "30b063ed-08ab-5694-9771-9427e9a07c6f" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399999 1081 "f(x)=x+{e}^{-3x}+C" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399999 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186399999 1084 #uuid "95477359-7c43-51b4-a1ff-890600150acd" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186400000 1081 "f(x)=x-18{e}^{-3x}+C" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186400000 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186400000 1084 #uuid "4a2d9c2f-bf87-54d1-a5c5-0103894f75e3" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186400001 1081 "f(x)=2(x-3{e}^{-3x})+C" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186400001 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186400001 1084 #uuid "3694a7a7-cd54-5712-bdcb-421abc079139" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186400002 1068 #edb/ref 17592186400003 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186400002 1069 "q-120450" 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186400002 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533480 17592186045585 true] [17592186400002 1071 "Find the numbers